      "message": "At the end, this directory will be similar to Dawn [[here]](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/partition_alloc/BUILD.gn)\n\nIn a follow-up, the \"raw_ptr\u003cT\u003e\" definition will be added to this directory. It will either be:\n1. \"Delegated to by partition_alloc\"\n2. \"Provided by skia\"\n\nThe \"Skia\" implementation will be a regular pointer, used in production for non-chromium project.\n\nIt will be imported as part of the Skia target named \"partition_alloc\". \n\nI can split \"partition_alloc\" and \"test_support\" into two directories if needed. However I would still have to find a location for where the \"src/partition_alloc\" \n at the end, and the logic for `skia_enable_partition_alloc` would have to be duplicated.\n\nIn this case, do you agree keeping `src/partition_alloc` WDYT?",
